# Everything under build/ is generated: the desktop test tree (test_host, the
# core .so, the sanitizer tree) and the generated probe ROM. `make -C
# engine/src/test/native run` regenerates the ROM, and the core .so is rebuilt
# from third_party/fceumm_next on every build.
